abstract: >-
  NAAIL OpenLab™ V2026.4-R1 is a public research-infrastructure release for
  evidence-governed accounting, auditing, assurance, finance, sustainability,
  CAM/KAM, open-agent tooling, reproducible cross-platform research packaging,
  provenance, independent review, and human approval. The release does not
  claim that registered experiments or external integrations have been
  independently scientifically validated. The validated historical executable
  checkpoint remains NAAIL OpenLab v0.2.3, Audit Workspace V0.4, Prototype 003.
